<section class="monitoring-decisions wrap">
  <div class="monitoring-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Plan the expectations</p><h2>An alert is only useful when the next step is clear.</h2><p>The monitoring conversation should begin with business priorities, not a generic list of every possible notification.</p></div>
